                sender +
                        receiver +
                        Double.toString(amount) +
                        timestamp
        );
        return calculatedhash;
    }
}
Now, your task is to add a new feature to the payment system that allows for a dynamic fee calculation based on the size of the transaction data. Specifically, the fee should increase by 0.001 BTC for every 100 characters in the XML transaction data. 
For example, if the transaction data is 500 characters long, the fee would be 0.005 BTC. If the transaction data is 1000 characters long, the fee would be 0.01 BTC, and so on.
